## 8. SECURITY FEATURES (implement all, non-negotiable)

- **Supabase Row-Level Security on EVERY table**:
  - Public read: products, reviews, blog_posts (published), hero_slides, rewards, loyalty_config, store_settings (public fields only), home_content.
  - Owner-or-admin read: orders, order_items, addresses, loyalty_accounts, loyalty_transactions, reward_redemptions (`customer_user_id` / `user_id` = `auth.uid()` OR `role = admin`).
  - Owner write: addresses (own only).
  - Admin-only create/update/delete: products, orders, discounts, blog, hero, home_content, store_settings, audit_logs, loyalty (manual adjust).
- **Auth security:** OTP email verification before login; password reset via Supabase recovery (generic success, no email enumeration); optional 2FA; session timeout configurable; role checks server-side via Edge Functions (never trust client role for writes).
- **Server-side trust boundary:** all order creation, payment, stock reservation, coupon validation, loyalty mutations run in **Supabase Edge Functions** with the service role key — the browser never performs privileged writes.
- **Idempotency:** orders require an idempotency key to prevent double-submit / double-charge.
- **Inventory atomicity:** stock reservation uses atomic DB transactions (decrement with `WHERE stock >= qty`); no oversell.
- **Rate limiting:** order track-lookup by hashed IP (max N/10min); auth + OTP endpoints rate-limited (prevent brute-force / OTP spam).
- **Input validation & sanitization:** server-side Zod/schema validation on every mutation; HTML-escape all user content (reviews, addresses); CSP-safe rendering; no raw `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` on user input.
- **Secrets:** all keys (Resend, Google OAuth, payment keys) in Supabase secrets / Edge Function env — never committed, never sent to the browser.
- **HTTPS / headers:** force HTTPS; security headers — `Content-Security-Policy`, `Strict-Transport-Security`, `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff`, `Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin`, `Permissions-Policy`.
- **Audit logging:** every admin create/update/delete writes to `audit_logs` (actor, action, entity, id, details, timestamp).
- **Abuse prevention:** coupon `used_count` increments atomically; abandoned-cart emails screened + rate-limited; newsletter/opt-in only.
- **GDPR-ish:** privacy center (delete account, export data); terms + privacy pages.
- **Maintenance mode:** admin-toggleable; shows a branded maintenance page to non-admins.

