## 12. AUTHENTICATION FLOWS (precise)

- Login: email+password (show/hide), Google OAuth full-width, forgot link, guest access. Post-login redirect honors a `returnTo` query param (fallback `/`).
- Register: multi-step — `register → OTP (120s countdown, resend disabled during countdown) → verifyOtp → redirect`. **Never auto-login an unverified user.**
- Forgot: `resetPasswordRequest(email)` → always generic success.
- Reset: `?token=` + new password+confirm → redirect to login.
- All auth calls wrapped in try/catch with inline errors; submit disabled while in-flight (except forgot, which always shows generic success).

