## 13. HOSTINGER DEPLOYMENT

- Build command produces a `dist/` SPA folder; deploy `dist/` to Hostinger (File Manager or Git deploy).
- **SPA fallback:** add `.htaccess` in `dist/`:
  ```
  RewriteEngine On
  RewriteBase /
  RewriteRule ^index\.html$ - [L]
  RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-f
  RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-d
  RewriteRule . /index.html [L]
  ```
  (so React Router deep links like `/product/slug` don't 404 on refresh).
- Supabase project URL + anon key in build env (safe for browser); service role key ONLY in Edge Functions.
